{"4229060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Guild Simulator", "steam_appid": 4229060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE WORLD OF THE CROSSROADS<strong>:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crossroads is a place for commoners to find solutions to their problems, and you're playing as a guildmaster who sends heroes on missions across the land.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229060/extras/99c6b97d9930249d5325e5a082bb0a97.poster.avif?t=1777550400\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229060/extras/99c6b97d9930249d5325e5a082bb0a97.webm?t=1777550400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229060/extras/99c6b97d9930249d5325e5a082bb0a97.mp4?t=1777550400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE THE GUILDMASTER:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People in the Crossroads have many problems in their lives. Some want you to catch their lost chicken, while others want you to defeat an elder legendary dragon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229060/extras/edcc51af9aa795cb2e3101de1816a452.poster.avif?t=1777550400\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229060/extras/edcc51af9aa795cb2e3101de1816a452.webm?t=1777550400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229060/extras/edcc51af9aa795cb2e3101de1816a452.mp4?t=1777550400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEND YOUR HEROES ACROSS THE LANDS. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Guildmaster, you choose the right hero for each quest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide who fits best—and how well they are equipped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229060/extras/a9b3987d12b33418a8fb1683f9dc3fee.poster.avif?t=1777550400\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229060/extras/a9b3987d12b33418a8fb1683f9dc3fee.webm?t=1777550400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229060/extras/a9b3987d12b33418a8fb1683f9dc3fee.mp4?t=1777550400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AUTO BATTLE SYSTEM WITH UNIQUE TRAITS AND QUIRKS<strong>.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle system is inspired by <i>Dispatch</i>, refined and extended with hero quirks and quest traits, bringing a well-known formula to even greater heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229060/extras/8a9288e33e0533b4cc2db8f21d56ba0d.poster.avif?t=1777550400\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229060/extras/8a9288e33e0533b4cc2db8f21d56ba0d.webm?t=1777550400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229060/extras/8a9288e33e0533b4cc2db8f21d56ba0d.mp4?t=1777550400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> FATE OF THE CROSSROADS DEPENDS ON YOUR </strong>COMPETENCE<strong>:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Crossroads is constantly changing as a result of your heroes’ journeys, and the fate of the world rests on your competence as a guildmaster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229060/extras/78534558f5db9bc31ae2ec4700288f25.poster.avif?t=1777550400\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229060/extras/78534558f5db9bc31ae2ec4700288f25.webm?t=1777550400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229060/extras/78534558f5db9bc31ae2ec4700288f25.mp4?t=1777550400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE WORLD OF THE CROSSROADS<strong>:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crossroads is a place for commoners to find solutions to their problems, and you're playing as a guildmaster who sends heroes on missions across the land.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229060/extras/99c6b97d9930249d5325e5a082bb0a97.poster.avif?t=1777550400\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229060/extras/99c6b97d9930249d5325e5a082bb0a97.webm?t=1777550400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4229060/extras/99c6b97d9930249d5325e5a082bb0a97.mp4?t=1777550400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE THE GUILDMASTER:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People in the Crossroads have many problems in their lives. Some want you to catc